X86 vibeos-wake-inbox-x86
(* The kernel's lock or is a full barrier. herd's X86 model rejects
   LOCK OR, so this is LOCK ADD of 1 from zero, the locked RMW it
   accepts. XCHG of the summary then of the word must not see a set
   summary with an empty word. No MFENCE. *)
{
}
 P0                     | P1                 ;
 LOCK ADD [word],$1     | MOV EAX,$0         ;
 LOCK ADD [summary],$1  | XCHG EAX,[summary] ;
                        | MOV EBX,$0         ;
                        | XCHG EBX,[word]    ;
exists (1:EAX=1 /\ 1:EBX=0)
